{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"12月もあと残り数えると一ヶ月もないのね...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それにしても今年も早かったなぁ～。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだかいろいろ思いかえすと去年に比べていろんなことを経験させていただいた年でしたねー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しは成長出来たかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんて最近しみじみよく考えるのです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しみじみ...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"世間はクリスマス一色。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間、表参道へ行った時にね、\n夜だったからイルミネーションがものすごくキラキラしててなんだか一人でたそがれちゃいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだろう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12月になるといつもこー、切ないというかなんともいえない絶妙な気持ちになるのよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも嫌いじゃないのそういう感じ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれ、夜にさ、帰り道とかでさ、外でさ、この時期だと寒いじゃない？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういう時にさ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"山下達郎さんのクリスマス・イブを聞くのよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく良い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、ちょっと一人とかだとPVぶっちゃうの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...これわかる人いるかなぁ～。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はこの時期になるとよくやります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たそがれたがり屋さんなのよね、結局。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/12/05/4902690/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...いやちがうな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/12/05/4902690/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそうこういう感じっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上、あみあみの12月あるあるでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間ねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちーちゃん、川後、真洋、ずーと\nディズニーシーに行ってきましたっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いえいいえいクリスマスのディズニーは最高っ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/12/05/4902690/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれ...ずーがいない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい、実はね、ずーは途中で体調が微妙になっちゃってね救護室でお休みしてました。  (´༎ຶ۝༎ຶ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ああー。だから川後がこんな画像を作ってくれたよっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/12/05/4902690/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほらねっ！これなら全然わかんないっ\n！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":".........うんキツイね。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもでもまたあみ達の思ひ出が一つ増えたねっ(^_-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうみんなーっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うぎっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、ちなみに遊んでばかりじゃないですよっ！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんとお仕事も頑張ってますからねっ！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そろそろ全国握手会もあるっ(#^.^#)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんに会えるのわくわくてかてかさせてますっ(⊙◞౪◟⊙)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んじゃっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/12/05/4902690/0004.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}